# unplugin-auto-import / unplugin-vue-components generate these. They are COMMITTED
# as cold-start stubs (like TanStack's routeTree.gen.ts) so `lint` + `typecheck`
# work on a fresh checkout before the first dev/build — eslint-plugin-vue enforces
# `no-undef`, which needs the injected globals present. Regenerated (identical bytes)
# on every dev/build; re-commit only when the auto-imported surface changes.
